Alembic migrations. Every schema change is a migration (see CLAUDE.md).

    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add surveys table"
    uv run alembic upgrade head
    uv run alembic downgrade -1

The database URL comes from DATABASE_URL (via app.config), never from alembic.ini.
Import new model modules in app/models/__init__.py so autogenerate can see them.
